ucha por sus vidas al verse atrapados en una batalla entre la Asociación de Propietarios y una avalancha de monstruos infernales. Esta comedia de terror aborda la actual preocupación de ser propietario de una vivienda y la convierte en una emocionante aventura llena de acción.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1481603","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:25:48.200Z"},{"id":"movie-1797863","slug":"movie-1797863","title":"AEW WrestleDream 2026: Saturday Tailgate Brawl","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6ABWPeYBMye9cweDymX2CL4t3lD.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1797863","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:25:48.553Z"},{"id":"movie-1468683","slug":"movie-1468683","title":"Heartstopper para siempre","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r4lVJVO1BeBb11cBcXBdbHc9e9k.jpg","synopsis":"Empieza un nuevo curso para la pandilla de Truham-Higgs. Mientras la relación de Nick y Charlie se hace más fuerte, ambos piensan en cómo será su futuro.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1468683","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:25:48.910Z"},{"id":"movie-1309406","slug":"movie-1309406","title":"Fils de personne","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gqgSRmOcSoMaL6J7MCYTm2UlrBl.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1309406","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:25:49.258Z"},{"id":"movie-1740877","slug":"movie-1740877","title":"Sesame Street y la tormenta","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oMAuDxxMPxzHjUmbrCR9EvJyH8U.jpg","synopsis":"Despué