:"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1359607","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:27:29.871Z"},{"id":"movie-1773353","slug":"movie-1773353","title":"A Season of Promises","image":null,"synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1773353","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:27:30.261Z"},{"id":"movie-49026","slug":"movie-49026","title":"El caballero oscuro: La leyenda renace","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rrS7K8tXVFUBliIKWaRuSq65nWr.jpg","synopsis":"Hace ocho años que Batman desapareció, dejando de ser un héroe para convertirse en un fugitivo. Al asumir la culpa por la muerte del fiscal del distrito Harvey Dent, el Caballero Oscuro decidió sacrificarlo todo por lo que consideraba, al igual que el Comisario Gordon, un bien mayor. La mentira funciona durante un tiempo, ya que la actividad criminal de la ciudad de Gotham se ve aplacada gracias a la dura Ley Dent. Pero todo cambia con la llegada de una astuta gata ladrona que pretende llevar a cabo un misterioso plan. Sin embargo, mucho más peligrosa es la aparición en escena de Bane, un terrorista enmascarado cuyos despiadados planes obligan a Bruce a regresar de su voluntario exilio.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/49026","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2012,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:27:30.610Z"},{"id":"movie-1364629","slug":"movie-1364629","title":"无名女孩","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5A1dG9Plbr5OkSNVrZqRsDKeoc5.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1364629","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2027,"updatedAt"