icto del jurado y potencialmente condenar (o liberar) al asesino acusado.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1106739","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:27:42.712Z"},{"id":"movie-1471317","slug":"movie-1471317","title":"Death Name","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uhyhWRzgCSiVfY0Ighgz9ujP85T.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Película de TV"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1471317","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:27:43.066Z"},{"id":"movie-1514378","slug":"movie-1514378","title":"U.V.F: Underground Video Films","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tN1X3MfKUqMKzZOhXmAK911vdaN.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1514378","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:27:43.415Z"},{"id":"movie-970450","slug":"movie-970450","title":"El despertar de la bestia","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wHsQwrqiICdEkIXFcX968rVqB3s.jpg","synopsis":"Un año después de que la luz de una superluna activara un gen latente, transformando a los humanos en hombres lobo sedientos de sangre y causando casi mil millones de muertes, la pesadilla resurge con la llegada de la superluna. Dos científicos intentan detener la mutación, pero fracasan y ahora deben luchar para llegar a la casa de uno de sus familiares.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Terror","Suspense","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/970450","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:27:43.763Z"},{"id":"movie-1711926","slug":"movie-1711926","title":"Ephemera","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cLwyh2HuMLnQAxFa7liDKka4pdn.jpg","synops