ham y viaja en secreto por el mundo, buscando los medios de luchar contra la injusticia y utilizar el miedo contra los que se aprovechan de los que tienen miedo. Con la ayuda de su leal mayordomo Alfred, el detective Jim Gordon - uno de los pocos buenos policías de las fuerzas del orden público de Gotham - y Lucius Fox, su aliado en la división de Ciencias Aplicadas de Wayne Enterprises, Bruce Wayne libera a su imponente alter ego: Batman, un justiciero enmascarado que utiliza la fuerza, la inteligencia y un despliegue de artefactos de alta tecnología para combatir las fuerzas siniestras que amenazan con destruir la ciudad.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Crimen","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/272","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2005,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:16.715Z"},{"id":"movie-1304434","slug":"movie-1304434","title":"Nadie","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t3Rs1BeIDXhwjOt10iyjiFe7BpL.jpg","synopsis":"El pequeño demonio cerdo decidió abandonar la Montaña Langlang y formar un equipo de base con el demonio sapo, el demonio comadreja y el demonio gorila, para emprender el viaje hacia el oeste.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Aventura","Fantasía","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1304434","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:17.103Z"},{"id":"movie-1516456","slug":"movie-1516456","title":"گوسٹ اسکول","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d36eqygq3ReUBgS2ytmjrho26OH.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1516456","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:17.457Z"},{"id":"movie-630","slug":"movie-630","title":"El mago de Oz","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ymUY2iIm8IuSYuIX1SsABgPyB48.jpg","synopsis":"La huérfana Dorothy Gale vive una vida sencilla en Kansas con su tía Emma Clara Blandick, su tío Henry y tres pintorescos peones: Hunk, Zeke y Hickory. Un día la severa vecina Miss Gulch es mordida por el perro de Dorothy, Toto. Miss Gulch se lo lleva, por orden del sheriff, a pesar de las apasionadas protestas de tía Emma y el tío Henry. Toto escapa y regresa junto a Dorothy, la cual se alegra momentáneamente, pero pronto se da cuenta de que Miss Gulch regresará. Decide llevarse a Toto y fugarse en busca de una vida mejor 'en algún lugar sobre el arco iris'.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/630","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1939,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:17.797Z"},{"id":"movie-1592410","slug":"movie-1592410","title":"Socorro! Minha Babá Tirou Férias!","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nmUHSmxdtziMndnz0ArbHCxMibG.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Familia","Película de TV","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1592410","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:18.143Z"},{"id":"movie-1381151","slug":"movie-1381151","title":"Holy Days","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bQuH4CVkdKoHtOksYu8q4g3nsNa.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1381151","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:18.522Z"},{"id":"movie-1280608","slug":"movie-1280608","title":"Evil Dead Wrath","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r10fSbmxDipJG6VOyt9nkX3zEbx.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1280608","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2028,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:18.867Z"},{"id":"movie-