aje espacial a un remoto planeta, en el que sus límites físicos y mentales serán puestos a prueba. El motivo de la misión es que los humanos creen que allá podrán encontrar las respuestas a las preguntas más profundas y al mayor de los misterios: el origen de la vida en la Tierra.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción","Misterio","Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/70981","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2012,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:21.350Z"},{"id":"movie-381288","slug":"movie-381288","title":"Múltiple","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Ag51YF1ZTNTefjhVMVGBCFv8h5s.jpg","synopsis":"A pesar de que Kevin le ha demostrado a su psiquiatra de confianza, la Dra. Fletcher, que posee 23 personalidades diferentes, aún queda una por emerger, decidida a dominar a todas las demás. Obligado a raptar a tres chicas adolescentes encabezadas por la decidida y observadora Casey, Kevin lucha por sobrevivir contra todas sus personalidades y la gente que le rodea, a medida que las paredes de sus compartimentos mentales se derrumban.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/381288","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2017,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:21.694Z"},{"id":"movie-1424435","slug":"movie-1424435","title":"万米危机","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dB8adJetrhgmzA1gQXCUXSuM5li.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1424435","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:22.059Z"},{"id":"movie-1789679","slug":"movie-1789679","title":"Shattered Soul","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k77LHNV9Ly3Lz8Bd68lH7cVDfpv.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1789679","