nado las Bolas de Dragón, y Krilin, su compañero de aventuras, entre otros.","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"totalEpisodes":153,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/12609-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":1986,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:27.867Z"},{"id":"tv-224941","slug":"tv-224941","title":"The Boroughs: Jubilación rebelde","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pIXvmq8Gcg9QgHqBvtY4vpVymva.jpg","synopsis":"En un complejo residencial para jubilados que parece perfecto, un peculiar grupo de héroes se enfrenta a una amenaza de otro mundo dispuesta a robarles lo que no tienen: tiempo.","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":8,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/224941-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:28.216Z"},{"id":"tv-291074","slug":"tv-291074","title":"TED: The Animated Series","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y75yXTixSGBjLmtPCu6plFlXPTj.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":8,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/291074-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:28.559Z"},{"id":"tv-90228","slug":"tv-90228","title":"Dune: La profecía","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kwWQHEBTL2TrUFcINqgLjSJdqIQ.jpg","synopsis":"Ambientada 10.000 años antes de los acontecimientos de la novela Dune de 1965, la serie sigue a las hermanas Valya y Tula Harkonnen en su lucha contra las fuerzas que amenazan el futuro de la humanidad y en la creación de la legendaria secta conocida como las Bene Gesserit.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Drama","Action & Adventure"],"totalEpisodes":14,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/90228-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:28.910Z"},{"id":"tv-98031","slug":"tv-98031","title":"奔跑吧","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jOl12DTFiMcp9ga2KaEKwt5H8oo.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Reality"],"totalEpisodes":173,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/98031-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2014,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:29.252Z"},{"id":"tv-61833","slug":"tv-61833","title":"Expedición al pasado","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4OiM6apNckkqo04I7TO5VmQl65R.jpg","synopsis":"Expedición al pasado narra las aventuras de Josh Gates mientras investiga misterios icónicos en todo el mundo. Gates comienza entrevistando a testigos oculares clave y descubriendo desarrollos recientes en la historia, luego se lanza a una exploración totalmente inmersiva. Esta auténtica aventura lleva a Gates más cerca de la verdad detrás de estos enigmas globales sin respuesta, como la desaparición del avión de Amelia Earhart. Josh Gates es un aventurero y ávido explorador con un estilo único de humor y pasión por las excursiones fuera del mapa.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Documental","Reality","Action & Adventure"],"totalEpisodes":168,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/61833-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2015,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:29.603Z"},{"id":"tv-291334","slug":"tv-291334","title":"The Fall and Rise of Reggie Dinkins","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lrF8Ve4GoazCalfbrSY52tUIXSN.jpg","synopsis":"Un exjugador de fútbol americano caído en desgracia (Tracy Morgan) busca la redención e intenta restaurar su dañada reputación.\n\nCríticas","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":18,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/291334-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:29.952Z"},{"id":"tv-329396","slug":"tv-329396","title":"夏之箱","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/baSkvuu34F1vQtPtwwWrykpy2vP.jpg","synopsis":null,"status"