a","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":92,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/39249-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":1995,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:45:26.460Z"},{"id":"tv-86248","slug":"tv-86248","title":"Upload","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6TPGDrU9MyWbn2TpggJphVAVXiq.jpg","synopsis":"En un futuro en el que los humanos pueden 'cargarse' a su elección preferida de la otra vida, Nathan se encuentra con su muerte temprana y Nora lo saluda en su versión del cielo. La serie sigue a los dos a medida que Nathan se acostumbra a la vida lejos de sus seres queridos, y la vivaracha Nora lucha por mantenerse a flote trabajando en su trabajo en el más allá.","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":29,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/86248-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2020,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:45:26.802Z"},{"id":"tv-85219","slug":"tv-85219","title":"少年歌行","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A1RbBXzNWzFdIzBv7Z837mUKitH.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure"],"totalEpisodes":112,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/85219-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2018,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:45:27.154Z"},{"id":"tv-318010","slug":"tv-318010","title":"Полдень","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/krH22FiieKHi2OE8Qe1yMWclp6n.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"totalEpisodes":6,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/318010-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:45:27.698Z"},{"id":"tv-68287","slug":"tv-68287","title":"Wunderschön!","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mPXzwheCTrTWZJtUeueOkv00pL1.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":372,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/68287-tv","type":"flyflix","content