ttps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cLcarnYaKBiIssUqp5bq76Dxj2p.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Reality"],"totalEpisodes":152,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/107467-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2013,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:45:41.684Z"},{"id":"tv-2750","slug":"tv-2750","title":"Testigo mudo","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yRwf0yAZvYMfFLMonPusv6F256s.jpg","synopsis":"Investigación de crímenes hecha por un experto equipo de patólogos forenses, que descubre la verdad detrás de muertes sospechosas, hablando por aquellos que ya no tienen voz.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Crimen","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":268,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/2750-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":1996,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:45:42.030Z"},{"id":"tv-285818","slug":"tv-285818","title":"Mistress Kanan Is Devilishly Easy","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jYIDlm7E6ji0QtBpGypZHII2Anq.jpg","synopsis":"Kanan, la \"Diablesa Gourmet\", ha descendido al mundo humano con un único objetivo: darse un festín de almas jóvenes. Su primera presa es el estudiante Youji Kyougi... ¡pero su plan sale rematadamente mal! En vez de convertirse en su comida, ahora es su... ¿novio? Aunque lleva miles de años viviendo, Kanan nunca ha conocido el amor. ¿Podrá una diablesa sobrevivir a su primer romance?","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"totalEpisodes":12,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/285818-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:45:42.517Z"},{"id":"tv-261391","slug":"tv-261391","title":"喜剧之王单口季","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/maUdaihGn6cEwaBXnujHdy9ENhp.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Reality","Talk","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":102,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/261391-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2024,"updatedA